title: "Industrial Data Valuation: A Research Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "Kukai-7"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kukai-7/industrial-data-valuation"
url: "https://kukai-7.github.io/industrial-data-valuation/"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible framework for ranking the value of a portfolio of industrial
  datasets treated as an intangible asset: a 17-criterion compliance grid, a
  hybrid of cost, market and income approaches, sensitivity analysis, Monte
  Carlo simulation and AHP weighting. Values are relative rankings, not an
  opposable price.
keywords:
  - data valuation
  - intangible assets
  - industrial data
  - data quality
  - Monte Carlo
  - AHP
